  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing sustainable water management, notably transboundary water resouces in South East Europe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the framework of IHP IX, providing support to decision- and policy-makers for a sustainable management of shared water resources and related ecosystem services in river basins  and aquifer systems in the South East European Region, with a particular focus on transboundary ones, notably in the context of global change. Promoting Eco-hydrological and holistic approaches ( Source-to-Sea) notably within the UNESCO designated sites. Providing policy advice to governments, collaborating with regional commissions in river basin management, supporting the IHP Danube network, and organizing capacity-building workshops and high level symposia.</narrative>
  </description>
